There are 2 groups in AD
------------------------
Security Groups: Security groups are used to manage access permissions to network resources. Users can be added to security groups, and permissions 
can be assigned to these groups to control resource access.

Distribution Groups: Distribution groups are used for sending email messages to a group of recipients. They do not have security-related permissions and 
are primarily used for email distribution purposes.

